msgstr "打包机处于活动状态"

msgid "If not checked, the bundler will not split up aggregates."
msgstr "如果未选中，那么打包机将不会拆分聚合。"

msgid "CSS Bundling options."
msgstr "CSS 绑定选项。"

msgid "Target Number Of CSS Bundles Per Page"
msgstr "每页的目标 CSS 捆绑软件数"

msgid "If 0 is selected then the bundler is disabled"
msgstr "如果选择 0，那么将禁用打包机"

msgid "Grouping logic"
msgstr "分组逻辑"

msgid "File count"
msgstr "文件计数"

msgid "File size"
msgstr "文件大小"

msgid "If file count is selected then each bundle will try to have a similar number of original files aggregated inside of it. If file size is selected then each bundle will try to have a similar file size."
msgstr "如果选择了文件计数，那么每个捆绑软件都将尝试在其内部聚合相似数目的原始文件。 如果选择了文件大小，那么每个捆绑软件都将尝试具有相似的文件大小。"

msgid "JavaScript Bundling options."
msgstr "JavaScript 绑定选项。"

msgid "Target Number Of JS Bundles Per Page"
msgstr "每页的目标 JS 捆绑软件数"

msgid "AdvAgg CDN"
msgstr "AdvAgg CDN"

msgid "Use a shared CDN for JavaScript and/or CSS libraries, Google Libraries API currently."
msgstr "将共享 CDN 用于 JavaScript 和/或 CSS 库（目前采用 Google 库 API）。"

msgid "AdvAgg CSS Minify"
msgstr "AdvAgg CSS 合并压缩"

msgid "AdvAgg CSS Minification is disabled."
msgstr "已禁用 AdvAgg CSS 合并压缩。"

msgid "Go to the <a href=\"@settings\">AdvAgg Minify CSS settings page</a> and select a minifier, or go to the <a href=\"@modules\">modules page</a> and disable the \"AdvAgg Minify CSS\" module."
msgstr "转至 <a href=\"@settings\">AdvAgg 缩小 CSS 设置</a>页面并选择一个缩小器，或者转至<a href=\"@modules\">模块页面</a>并禁用“AdvAgg 缩小 CSS”模块。"

msgid "AdvAgg Minify CSS"
msgstr "AdvAgg 合并压缩 CSS"

msgid "Minify CSS."
msgstr "合并压缩 CSS。"

msgid "CSS Minification"
msgstr "CSS 合并压缩"

msgid "AdvAgg CSS minification settings."
msgstr "AdvAgg CSS 合并压缩设置。"

msgid "AdvAgg: CSS Minification"
msgstr "AdvAgg：CSS 合并压缩"

msgid "Which minifier to use. 0 is Disabled."
msgstr "要使用的合并压缩工具。 0 表示已禁用。"

msgid "Add licensing information to aggregates for individual source files."
msgstr "将许可信息添加到各源文件的聚合中。"

msgid "The settings below will not have any effect because AdvAgg is currently in <a href=\"@devel\">development mode</a>. Once the cache settings have been set to a non-development level, CSS minification will take place."
msgstr "以下设置将不会产生任何影响，因为 AdvAgg 当前处于<a href=\"@devel\">开发方式</a>。 一旦将高速缓存设置设定为非开发级别，就将进行 CSS 合并压缩。"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已禁用"

msgid "Core"
msgstr "核心"

msgid "YUI Compressor"
msgstr "YUI 压缩器"

msgid "Minification: Select a minifier"
msgstr "合并压缩：选择合并压缩工具"

msgid "Add licensing comments"
msgstr "添加许可注释"

msgid ""
"If unchecked, the Advanced Aggregation module's licensing comments\n"
"      will be omitted from the aggregated files. Omitting the comments will produce somewhat better scores in\n"
"      some automated security scans but otherwise should not affect your site. These are included by default in order to better follow the spirit of the GPL by providing the source for javascript files."
msgstr ""
"如果未选中此选项，那么将在汇总文件中\n"
"省略“高级汇总”模块的许可注释。 省略注释将会在某些自动安全扫描中\n"
"产生更好的分数，但不应影响您的站点。 缺省情况下，将包含这些注释，以便能够通过提供 JavaScript 文件来源更好地遵循 GPL 的精神。"

msgid "Advagg External Minification: PHP shell_exec"
msgstr "Advagg 外部合并压缩：PHP shell_exec"

msgid "PHP shell_exec is non-functional."
msgstr "PHP shell_exec 不可用。"

msgid "Check php.ini for safemode or <a href=\"@link\" target=\"_blank\">disable_functions</a>."
msgstr "检查 php.ini 以找到 safemode 或 <a href=\"@link\" target=\"_blank\">disable_functions</a>。"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "已启用"

msgid "AdvAgg External Minification"
msgstr "AdvAgg 外部合并压缩"

msgid "Minify Javascript and/or CSS with a command line minifier."
msgstr "使用命令行合并压缩工具来合并压缩 JavaScript 和/或 CSS。"

msgid "External Minification"
msgstr "外部合并压缩"

msgid "AdvAgg external minification settings."
msgstr "AdvAgg 外部合并压缩设置。"

msgid "AdvAgg: External Minifiers"
msgstr "AdvAgg：外部合并压缩工具"

msgid "Command line for external CSS minification."
msgstr "用于外部 CSS 合并压缩的命令行。"

msgid "Whether to use the external CSS minifier if configured."
msgstr "是否使用外部 CSS 合并压缩工具（如果已配置）。"

msgid "Command line for external JavaScript minification."
msgstr "用于外部 JavaScript 合并压缩的命令行。"

msgid "Whether to use the external JS minifier if configured."
msgstr "是否使用外部 JS 合并压缩工具（如果已配置）。"

msgid "CSS"
msgstr "CSS"

msgid "JavaScript"
msgstr "JavaScript"

msgid "Command Line"
msgstr "命令行"

msgid "{%CWD%} = \\Drupal::root(). <br /> {%IN%} = input file. <br /> {%IN_URL_ENC%} = url pointing to the input file that has been url encoded. <br /> {%OUT%} = output file. <br /><br />"
msgstr "{%CWD%} = \\Drupal::root()。<br /> {%IN%} = 输入文件。<br /> {%IN_URL_ENC%} = 指向已进行 URL 编码的输入文件的 URL。<br /> {%OUT%} = 输出文件。<br /><br />"

msgid "Example using the <a href=\"@link1\">Microsoft Ajax Minifier</a>. <p><code>@code1</code></p>"
msgstr "使用 <a href=\"@link1\">Microsoft Ajax Minifier</a> 的示例。 <p><code>@code1</code></p>"

msgid "Example using the <a href=\"@link1\">Google Closure Compiler</a>. <p><code>@code1</code></p>"
msgstr "使用 <a href=\"@link1\">Google Closure Compiler</a> 的示例。 <p><code>@code1</code></p>"

msgid "Example using curl to minify via the <a href=\"@link1\">Online Google Closure Compiler</a>. <p><code>@code1</code></p>"
msgstr "使用 curl 通过<a href=\"@link1\">在线 Google Closure Compiler</a> 进行缩小的示例。<p><code>@code1</code></p>"

msgid "Example using the <a href=\"@link1\">YUI Compressor</a>. <p><code>@code1</code></p>"
msgstr "使用 <a href=\"@link1\">YUI Compressor</a> 的示例。<p><code>@code1</code></p>"

msgid "Example using curl to minify via an online <a href=\"@link1\">CSS Minifier</a>. <p><code>@code1</code></p>"
msgstr "使用 curl 通过在线 <a href=\"@link1\">CSS Minifier</a> 进行缩小的示例。<p><code>@code1</code></p>"

msgid "Command to run"
msgstr "要运行的命令"

msgid "Enable external @type minification"
msgstr "启用外部 @type 合并压缩"

msgid "AdvAgg JS Minify"
msgstr "AdvAgg JS 合并压缩"

msgid "AdvAgg JS Minification is disabled."
msgstr "已禁用 AdvAgg JS 合并压缩。"

msgid "Go to the <a href=\"@settings\">AdvAgg Minify JavaScript settings page</a> and select a minifier, or go to the <a href=\"@modules\">modules page</a> and disable the \"AdvAgg Minify Javascript\" module."
msgstr "转至 <a href=\"@settings\">AdvAgg 缩小 JavaScript 设置页面</a>并选择一个缩小器，或者转至<a href=\"@modules\">模块页面</a>并禁用“AdvAgg 缩小 Javascript”模块。"

msgid "AdvAgg Minify JavaScript"
msgstr "AdvAgg 合并压缩 JavaScript"

msgid "Minify JavaScript with a 3rd party minifier; JSMin+, JSMin c ext, JShrink, and JSqueeze currently."
msgstr "当前使用第三方合并压缩工具 JSMin+、JSMin c ext、JShrink 和 JSqueeze 来合并压缩 JavaScript。"

msgid "JavaScript Minification"
msgstr "JavaScript 合并压缩"

msgid "AdvAgg JavaScript minification settings."
msgstr "AdvAgg JavaScript 合并压缩设置。"

msgid "AdvAgg: JS Minification"
msgstr "AdvAgg：JS 合并压缩"

msgid "Minifier to use. 0 is disabled."
msgstr "要使用的合并压缩工具。 0 表示已禁用。"

msgid "Upper bound comparison value for the minification ratio test."
msgstr "合并压缩比率测试的上限比较值。"

msgid "Lower bound comparison value for the minification ratio test."
msgstr "合并压缩比率测试的下限比较值。"

msgid "The jsmin function does not exist. Using JSqueeze."
msgstr "JSMin 功能不存在。 请使用 JSqueze。"

msgid "JSMin had a possible error minifying: @file, correcting."
msgstr "JSMin 合并压缩 @file 时可能遇到了一个错误，正在进行更正。"

msgid "JSMin had an error minifying file: @file, attempting to correct."
msgstr "JSMin 合并压缩文件 @file 时遇到了一个错误，正在尝试进行更正。"

msgid "The currently installed jsmin version does not handle multibyte characters, you may consider to upgrade the jsmin extension. Using JSqueeze fallback."
msgstr "当前安装的 JSMin 版本不会处理多字节字符，可以考虑升级 JSMin 扩展。 请使用 JSqueeze 回退。"

msgid "The settings below will not have any effect because AdvAgg is currently in <a href=\"@devel\">development mode</a>. Once the cache settings have been set to a non-development level, JS minification will take place."
msgstr "以下设置将不会产生任何影响，因为 AdvAgg 当前处于<a href=\"@devel\">开发方式</a>。 一旦将高速缓存设置设定为非开发级别，就将进行 JS 合并压缩。"

msgid "JSMin+ ~1300ms"
msgstr "JSMin+ ~1300ms"

msgid "JShrink ~1000ms"
msgstr "JShrink ~1000ms"

msgid "JSqueeze ~600ms"
msgstr "JSqueeze ~600ms"

msgid "JSMin ~2ms"
msgstr "JSMin ~2ms"

msgid "JSMin is the very fast C complied version. Recommend using it."
msgstr "JSMin 是速度非常快的 C 编译版本。 建议使用此项。"

msgid "You can use the much faster C version of JSMin (~2ms) by installing the <a href=\"@php_jsmin\">JSMin PHP Extension</a> on this server."
msgstr "通过在此服务器上安装 <a href=\"@php_jsmin\">JSMin PHP 扩展</a>，可使用速度更快的 C 版本 JSMin (~2ms)。"

msgid "AdvAgg Modifier"
msgstr "AdvAgg 修改器"

msgid "Allows one to alter the CSS and JS array."
msgstr "允许更改 CSS 和 JS 数组。"

msgid "Modifications"
msgstr "修改"

msgid "AdvAgg Modifications."
msgstr "AdvAgg 修改。"

msgid "AdvAgg: Modifications"
msgstr "AdvAgg：修改"

msgid "Default value to adjust the sorting of browser conditional CSS."
msgstr "用于调整浏览器条件 CSS 排序的缺省值。"

msgid "Default value to adjust the sorting of external CSS."
msgstr "用于调整外部 CSS 排序的缺省值。"

msgid "Default value to use JavaScript to defer CSS loading."
msgstr "用于使用 JavaScript 延迟装入 CSS 的缺省值。"

msgid "Whether to defer loading of CSS on the admin theme."
msgstr "是否在管理主题上延迟装入 CSS。"

msgid "Whether to also defer loading of external stylesheets."
msgstr "是否同时延迟装入外部样式表。"

msgid "Default value of the inclusion method for the loadCSS code."
msgstr "loadCSS 代码的包含方法的缺省值。"

msgid "Default value to turn on preprocessing for all CSS files."
msgstr "用于为所有 CSS 文件开启预处理的缺省值。"

msgid "Default value to translate the content attributes of CSS files."
msgstr "用于转换 CSS 文件内容属性的缺省值。"

msgid "Default value to adjust the sorting of external JavaScript"
msgstr "用于调整外部 JavaScript 排序的缺省值"

msgid "Default value to adjust the sorting of browser conditional JavaScript."
msgstr "用于调整浏览器条件 JavaScript 排序的缺省值。"

msgid "Default value to have async on all JS script tags."
msgstr "用于使所有 JS 脚本标记中均具有异步标记的缺省值。"

msgid "Default value to move async js to the header."
msgstr "用于将异步 JS 移至头部的缺省值。"

msgid "Default value to add the defer tag to all script tags."
msgstr "用于将延迟标记添加到所有脚本标记的缺省值。"

msgid "Default value to move all JS to the footer."
msgstr "用于将所有 JS 移至底部的缺省值。"

msgid "Default value to turn on preprocessing for all JavaScript files."
msgstr "用于为所有 JavaScript 文件开启预处理的缺省值。"

msgid "Remove console.log() calls from JavaScript files."
msgstr "从 JavaScript 文件中除去 console.log() 调用。"

msgid "Default value to use the prefetch tag for certain domains."
msgstr "用于对特定域使用预取标记的缺省值。"

msgid "Use one css/js directory for a multi-site."
msgstr "对多站点使用一个 CSS/JS 目录。"

msgid "@before"
msgstr "@before"

msgid "JS"
msgstr "JS"

msgid "Enable preprocess on all JS"
msgstr "对所有 JS 启用预处理"

msgid "Force all JavaScript to have the preprocess attribute be set to TRUE. All JavaScript files will be aggregated if enabled."
msgstr "强制所有 JavaScript 将预处理属性设置为 TRUE。 如启用，将聚合所有 JavaScript 文件。"

msgid "Remove console logging from JS files."
msgstr "从 JS 文件中除去控制台日志记录。"

msgid "Harmless under most cases, but may make debugging difficult. WARNING: experimental."
msgstr "在大多数情况下没有影响，但可能会使调试变得困难。 警告：实验版。"

msgid "Optimize JavaScript Ordering"
msgstr "优化 JavaScript 排序"

msgid "The settings in here might change the order in which the JavaScript is loaded. It will move the scripts around so that more optimal aggregates are built. In most cases enabling these checkboxes will cause no negative side effects."
msgstr "此处的设置可能会更改 JavaScript 的装入顺序。 它将移动这些脚本，以便构建更多最佳聚合。 在大多数情况下，启用这些复选框将不会产生任何负面作用。"

msgid "Move all external scripts to the top of the execution order"
msgstr "将所有外部脚本移至执行顺序顶部"

msgid "This will group all external JavaScript files to be above all other JavaScript."
msgstr "这会对所有外部 JavaScript 文件进行分组，使其位于所有其他 JavaScript 之上。"

msgid "Move all browser conditional JavaScript to the bottom of the group"
msgstr "将所有浏览器条件 JavaScript 移至该组的底部"

msgid "This will group all browser conditional JavaScript to be in the lowest group of that conditional rule."
msgstr "这会对所有浏览器条件 JavaScript 进行分组，使其位于该条件规则最下方的组中。"

msgid "Adjust javascript location and execution"
msgstr "调整 JavaScript 位置和执行"

msgid "Most of the time adjusting the settings are safe but in some rare cases adjusting these can cause serious JavaScript issues with your site."
msgstr "大多数时间内调整设置是安全的，但在某些罕见的情况下，调整这些设置可能会导致您的站点出现严重的 JavaScript 问题。"

msgid "Deferred JavaScript Execution: Add The defer Tag To All Script Tags"
msgstr "延迟 JavaScript 执行：将延迟标记添加到所有脚本标记"

msgid "All but external scripts"
msgstr "除外部脚本外的所有脚本"

msgid "All (might break things)"
msgstr "全部（可能会导致中断）"

msgid "This will delay the script execution until the HTML parser has finished. This will have a similar effect to moving all JavaScript to the footer. This might break javascript (especially inline); only use after extensive testing! <a href=\"@link\">More Info</a>"
msgstr "这将延迟执行脚本，直至 HTML 解析器完成解析。 这与将所有 JavaScript 移至页脚具有相似的效果。 这可能会中断 JavaScript（尤其是内联）；请仅在广泛测试后使用！ <a href=\"@link\">更多信息</a>"

msgid "Experimental Settings"
msgstr "实验设置"

msgid "Here there be dragons! Asynchronous JavaScript Execution: Add The async Tag To All Script Tags"
msgstr "此处有龙！ 异步 JavaScript 执行：将异步标记添加到所有脚本标记"

msgid "This will cause the script to be downloaded in the background and executed out of order. This will break most javascript as most code is not async safe; only use after extensive testing! <a href=\"@link\">More Info</a>"
msgstr "这将导致在后台下载脚本并且无序执行。 这将中断大多数的 JavaScript，因为大多数代码都不是异步安全的；请仅在广泛测试后使用！ <a href=\"@link\">更多信息</a>"

msgid "Asynchronous JavaScript Execution: Group together in the header"
msgstr "异步执行 JavaScript：在头中分组在一起"

msgid "This will move all async JavaScript code to the header in the same group."
msgstr "这会将所有异步 JavaScript 代码均移至同一组中的头。"

msgid "Enable preprocess on all CSS"
msgstr "对所有 CSS 启用预处理"

msgid "Force all CSS to have the preprocess attribute be set to TRUE. All CSS files will be aggregated if enabled."
msgstr "强制所有 CSS 将预处理属性设置为 TRUE。 如启用，将聚合所有 CSS 文件。"

msgid "You might want to increase the <a href=\"@link\">CSS Bundles Per Page</a> if this is checked."
msgstr "如果选中此项，那么您可能希望增加<a href=\"@link\">每页的 CSS 捆绑软件数</a>。"

msgid "Translate CSS content strings"
msgstr "转换 CSS 内容字符串"

msgid "Run strings inside of quotes of the content attribute through the <a href=\"@t\">t() function</a>. An alternative to this can be found in this <a href=\"@post\">blog post</a>."
msgstr "通过 <a href=\"@t\">t() 函数</a>运行内容属性引号内的字符串。 在此<a href=\"@post\">博客帖子</a>中可以找到相应的备选项。"

msgid "Optimize CSS Ordering"
msgstr "优化 CSS 排序"

msgid "The settings in here might change the order in which the CSS is loaded. It will move the CSS around so that more optimal aggregates are built. In most cases enabling these checkboxes will cause no negative side effects."
msgstr "此处的设置可能会更改 CSS 的装入顺序。 它将移动 CSS，以便构建更多最佳聚合。 在大多数情况下，启用这些复选框将不会产生任何负面作用。"

msgid "Move all external CSS to the top of the execution order"
msgstr "将所有外部 CSS 移至执行顺序顶部"

msgid "This will group all external CSS files to be above all other CSS."
msgstr "这会对所有外部 CSS 文件进行分组，使其位于所有其他 CSS 之上。"

msgid "Move all browser conditional CSS to the bottom of the group"
msgstr "将所有浏览器条件 CSS 移至该组的底部"

msgid "This will group all browser conditional CSS to be in the lowest group of that conditional rule."
msgstr "这会对所有浏览器条件 CSS 进行分组，使其位于该条件规则最下方的组中。"

msgid "Adjust CSS location and execution (Experimental)"
msgstr "调整 CSS 位置和执行（实验版）"

msgid "Deferred CSS Execution: Use JS to load CSS"
msgstr "延迟执行 CSS：使用 JS 装入 CSS"

msgid "Enabled (In head)"
msgstr "已启用（在头中）"

msgid "This will try to optimize CSS delivery by using JavaScript to load the CSS. This might break CSS on different browsers and will cause a flash of unstyled content (FOUC). Only enable after extensive testing! <a href=\"@link\">More Info</a>"
msgstr "这将尝试通过使用 JavaScript 装入 CSS 来优化 CSS 交付。 这可能会在不同的浏览器上中断 CSS，并将导致无样式内容闪烁 (FOUC)。 请仅在广泛测试后启用！ <a href=\"@link\">更多信息</a>"

msgid "Use JS to load CSS in the admin theme"
msgstr "使用 JS 在管理主题中装入 CSS"

msgid "This will optimize CSS delivery with JavaScript when viewing the admin theme."
msgstr "这将在查看管理主题时使用 JavaScript 优化 CSS 交付。"

msgid "Use JS to load external CSS"
msgstr "使用 JS 装入外部 CSS"

msgid "This will optimize CSS delivery with JavaScript for external stylesheets."
msgstr "这将针对外部样式表使用 JavaScript 优化 CSS 交付。"

msgid "How to include the JS loading code"
msgstr "如何包含 JS 装入代码"

msgid "Inline javascript loader library (If enabled this is recommended)"
msgstr "内联 JavaScript 装入程序库（如已启用，建议使用）"

msgid "Local file included in aggregate"
msgstr "聚合中包含的本地文件"

msgid "Externally load the latest from github"
msgstr "从 github 外部装入最新内容"

msgid "The <a href=\"@link\">loadCSS</a> library can be included in various ways."
msgstr "可以通过各种方式包含 <a href=\"@link\">loadCSS</a> 库。"

